5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'll lead us to victory! We need to be aggressive and find the wolf quickly. Don't let them trick you with fancy words.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,Let us approach this with a calm heart. Wisdom comes to those who listen and observe the harmony of our words.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help. I think we should all be kind to each other while we search.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I will simply observe. The truth usually reveals itself through the gaps in a person's emotional reactions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will prioritize rational evidence and logical consistency over intuition. Let us focus on verifiable facts rather than feelings.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, @Midori, being too soft will just help the wolf hide. We need to pressure the suspects until they crack!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Pressure can cloud the mind, Takumi. A gentle breeze often reveals more than a storm. Let us watch how each person reacts to the truth.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I understand, Takumi, but I hope we can avoid fighting. If we stay friendly, maybe the wolf will feel uncomfortable and slip up?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, your aggression is a useful tool, but it can also be a mask. I'll be watching who tries to redirect the focus.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Toshio. Emotional outbursts are irrelevant. We should analyze the contradictions in statements to identify the deceiver.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not masking anything! I'm just the only one here ready to take action. I'll find the wolf, even if I have to do it alone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"There is strength in unity, my friend. Let us support one another. The light of truth shines brightest when we stand together.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. I really want us all to get along. It would be so sad if we turned on each other too quickly.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,The contrast in your temperaments is interesting. I will be analyzing how you all respond to the first piece of evidence we find.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Unity is a sentiment, not a strategy. The only way to ensure a correct execution is through a rigorous process of elimination.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, do your analyzing and your meditating. I'm going to focus on the results. Let's get this started!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,May we all find the clarity we seek. I look forward to our journey toward the truth.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,I'll do my best to support everyone. Let's please be careful and thoughtful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I have seen enough for now. I will wait for the first night to pass and see who emerges as the primary suspect.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will maintain my objective stance. I am ready to evaluate the data as it arrives.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
