33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Listen up! I've got a lead. Servas is human. Now we just need to figure out who among the rest is lying to us!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I am honored by your trust, Takumi. If my nature is known, let us use that stability to find the shadow among us.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh, that's a relief that Servas is human! But @Takumi, how can you be so sure? It feels a bit sudden.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, your sudden certainty is curious. I am observing how the others react to this claim, especially those who feel threatened.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, please explain the logical basis for your conclusion. A claim without a supporting argument is merely an intuition, which is unreliable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need to explain my methods to you, Ryuji! Just trust me. I'm the Seer, and I'm telling you Servas is clean!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"If Takumi is our Seer, we are blessed. However, we must remain humble. Even a Seer's words should be weighed with care.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"A Seer! That's amazing. I trust you, Takumi, but I'm just worried that the wolf might try to pretend to be the Seer too.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, you've revealed your role very early. That is a bold move. I'm watching to see if anyone tries to contradict you immediately.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Claiming the Seer role so early is a high-risk strategy. It either simplifies the game or provides a perfect cover for a werewolf.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not afraid of the risk! I'm the one who's going to save this village. Now, @Ryuji, @Toshio, you're both being way too suspicious.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,Let us not let suspicion turn into anger. Takumi has offered us a guiding light; let us see where it leads us with an open mind.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,Please don't fight! I feel so anxious when everyone is arguing. I believe Takumi is trying to help us all.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji is merely being analytical. My own detachment is not suspicion. However, the wolf is likely the one trying to blend in now.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"My analysis is not suspicion; it is a requirement for accuracy. If Takumi is the Seer, the wolf must be among the remaining three.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly! And I've got my eye on you, Ryuji. You're too focused on ""logic"" to hide your lies. I'm voting for you!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us breathe and think. While Ryuji is cold, coldness is not always a sign of malice. But we must make a choice for the village.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I don't want to vote for anyone... but if Takumi is the Seer, I should probably trust his intuition. I'm so sorry, Ryuji.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Ryuji's reactions have been consistent. However, the social dynamic is shifting. I will vote based on who is most likely to be the wolf.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"My behavior is consistent with my personality. Voting for me based on my demeanor is an emotional decision, not a logical one.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
