66,2,1,talk,Servas,,"A tragedy has befallen us. We lost a mind of logic, and now our brave leader, Takumi, has been taken from us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Midori,,Oh no! Takumi is gone! I can't believe it... I feel so terrible that we voted for Ryuji and then this happened.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The wolf attacked the Seer immediately after he revealed himself. This confirms Takumi's role and the wolf's fear of his power.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Servas,,"In the silence of loss, the truth becomes clearer. We are left with three. One of us is the wolf, and one may be their companion.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Midori,,I'm so scared... what if the wolf is right here with us? I just want this to be over so we can all be safe.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, your fear is palpable. @Servas, you are remarkably calm. I am comparing your emotional states to find the anomaly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Peace is the only way to see clearly, Toshio. When the heart is still, the ripples of deception become visible.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I can't help being scared! I'm not like you two. I just want to go home... please, can we just find the wolf?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The Possessed would act like a Villager to avoid suspicion. Midori's panic is a common shield, but Servas's serenity is a perfect mask.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a beautiful thing to be suspected, for it means one is being observed. I have nothing to hide but my age and my memories.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Midori,,"Please don't suspect each other! I'll do anything to help. I trust both of you, I really do!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The evidence is thin, but the pattern is clear. The wolf is the one who has remained the most invisible while others were targeted.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
